Package: net.blackcat.ivlc
Name: iVLC
Version: 1.0.0-1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Maintainer: BlackCat <blackcat@ivlc.local>
Description: Lightweight media player for jailbroken iOS 12+ using LibVLC and yt-dlp
 iVLC is a minimal C-based media player prototype that demonstrates
 end-to-end YouTube playback on jailbroken iOS devices. It uses yt-dlp
 to extract direct stream URLs and LibVLC for hardware-accelerated
 video/audio decoding and rendering.
 
 Features:
 - Pure C99 implementation (no Swift/Objective-C)
 - YouTube URL resolution via yt-dlp (Procursus APT)
 - LibVLC integration for media playback
 - ARM64 optimized for iOS 12.0+
 - Minimal dependencies
Depends: python3, ffmpeg, libvlc, libvlccore, firmware-ios (>= 12.0)
Section: Multimedia
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/blackcat/ivlc